   "reason": "Title lists PBRER data quality, responses to EDA and awareness of outcomes, but quote and statement stopped before those bullets; quote extended to include them.",
   "row": {
    "quote": "The QPPV shall be responsible for the establishment and maintenance of the pharmacovigilance\nsystem and therefore shall ensure that the pharmacovigilance system in place enables the\ncompliance with the requirements established for the production and submission of PBRERs. In\nrelation to the pharmaceutical products covered by the pharmacovigilance system, specific\nadditional responsibilities of the QPPV in relation to PBRERs shall include:\n•    Ensuring the necessary quality, including the correctness and completeness, of the data\n     submitted in the PBRERs;\n • Ensuring full response according to the timelines and within the procedure agreed (e.g. next\n     PBRER) to any request from EDA concerned related to PBRERs;\n • Awareness of the PBRER and assessment report conclusions and the decisions of EDA in\n     order to ensure that appropriate action takes place.",
    "statement": "The QPPV, being responsible for the PV system, shall ensure it enables compliance with PBRER production and submission requirements, and shall in particular ensure the quality (correctness and completeness) of PBRER data, ensure a full response within agreed timelines to any EDA request related to PBRERs, and be aware of PBRER and assessment report conclusions and EDA decisions so that appropriate action is taken.",
    "confidence": 92
   }
